3a
// Project copy (G1 repair project, 2026-10-27) of the g1-fw model: the accelerometer now samples at its
// ODR over virtual time (STATUS_REG XLDA set per sample, cleared by reading OUTZ_H_A), the FIFO's
// continuous mode stores accelerometer samples (BDR = ODR) with the watermark and overrun flags and the
// FIFO_DATA_OUT_TAG..Z_H words (one 7-byte word per sample, popped when Z_H is read), the wake-up function
// compares the slope ((cur - prev) / 2 per axis) with WK_THS (FS/64 or FS/256 per WAKE_THS_W) when
// INTERRUPTS_ENABLE is set, and INT1/INT2 drive GPIOs (Int1, Int2: DRDY_XL, FIFO_TH, WU; H_LACTIVE flips the
// level). Connect them from a script: sysbus.twim2.lsm6dso Int1 Connect sysbus.gpio1 15.
//
.
